 This package repackages LocalSend's prebuilt release files. The app bundles
 the Flutter engine, Dart packages and Flutter plugins, each under its own
 license; their notices ship inside the app at
 /usr/lib/localsend/data/flutter_assets/NOTICES.Z (zlib-compressed text),
 which the app also shows under its own license screen.

